  "implementation": [
    "Immutable original inviter, target membership epochs, capabilities and semantic invitation are captured atomically with the Session/journal/ordinary operation receipt; storage failure rolls back all rows.",
    "Mutable exact Session/Participant/epoch slot selects the latest original source. Acceptance, departure/reinvitation, readmission, terminal state and changed runtime cannot lend authority to stale handles.",
    "Descriptors hold no idle reader. Immediate fresh current-target metadata reader checks named permission, recipient ceilings, original source access and current epochs; it fences supported writers only during actual metadata IO.",
    "Production listener exercises signed native invitation, exact logical replay, actual accept/leave and HTTP reinvitation for EdDSA and ES256. Six Store cases also exercise contention, permission/revocation, backup/reconstruction, immutable history and atomic failure/recovery."
  ],
